{"id":"e468bfa09e147505","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3CertificateCorrect.md","title":"L3CertificateCorrect","display":"L3CertificateCorrect","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3CertificateCorrect","parameters":[],"formula_kind":"proof_obligation_formula"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3CertificateCorrect"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"proof_obligation_formula"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：接口端点。有序参数：无（闭公式）。</p>\n<p>有限表证书与有限前提语义后承对应命题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3CertificateCorrect)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall g\n  (forall a (implies (@ L3FiniteInput g a) (iff (exists p (@ L3Proof g p a)) (@ L3Conseq g a)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9104a0b6c6ec0569\" href=\"?note=9104a0b6c6ec0569\" title=\"ZFC_L3Conseq\">L3Conseq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e56e1132597c40e3\" href=\"?note=e56e1132597c40e3\" title=\"ZFC_L3FiniteInput\">L3FiniteInput</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"399e79d7cc96c3d4\" href=\"?note=399e79d7cc96c3d4\" title=\"ZFC_L3Proof\">L3Proof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>这是待证明命题的陈述，不是一个已证明定理，也不加入公理集。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ L3CertificateCorrect)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3Conseq","status":"resolved","id":"9104a0b6c6ec0569","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3Conseq|L3Conseq]]；[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_L3Proof|L3Proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3FiniteInput","status":"resolved","id":"e56e1132597c40e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3Conseq|L3Conseq]]；[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_L3Proof|L3Proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3Proof","status":"resolved","id":"399e79d7cc96c3d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3Conseq|L3Conseq]]；[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_L3Proof|L3Proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"这是待证明命题的陈述，不是一个已证明定理，也不加入公理集。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":900,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd45a4b3eda7a6d6","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3CertificateCorrect|L3CertificateCorrect]]"},{"id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_STCheckerCorrect]]、[[规范公式/ZFC_CurryCheckerCorrect]]、[[规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheckerCorrect]]、[[规范公式/ZFC_L3CertificateCorrect]] 均无自由变量。`展开样例/` 另附已消去所有命名缩写与派生逻辑记号的文本，供检查语法；它们**仍然只是待证公式**。"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-774","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_L3CertificateCorrect|L3CertificateCorrect]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","9104a0b6c6ec0569","e56e1132597c40e3","399e79d7cc96c3d4","593f9bdab4d60707"]}